---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import IndigoBlock from '../components/IndigoBlock.astro';
import Media from '../components/Media.astro';

const pillars = [
  { name: 'Attract', line: 'Bring the right people in. Forget cookie-cutter recruitment. We help you attract humans who believe in your mission, not just fill a seat. Extraordinary teams start with people who co-create your culture.' },
  { name: 'Align', line: 'Get everyone moving in the same direction. Vision only matters if people can feel it. We cut through noise and corporate fluff to align your people around shared purpose, clear strategy, and values that actually mean something.' },
  { name: 'Lead', line: 'Build leaders who multiply impact. Real leadership means building others strong enough to carry the weight with you - not carrying it alone. We grow leaders who empower, not control - the kind who lift everyone around them.' },
  { name: 'Retain', line: 'Keep your best humans thriving. Beanbags and ping-pong tables don’t keep great people - belonging, strengths and trust do. We help you create the kind of environment where people want to stay, and do the best work of their lives.' },
];
---
<Base
  title="About"
  description="People aren’t resources - they’re the reason organisations succeed. Meet Radical HR, the Humans First consultancy led by Lisa Shaw."
  current="about"
>
  {/* Hero */}
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">About us</p>
      <h1 class="display hero-h1">
        People aren’t “resources.”
      </h1>
      <p class="body-lg hero-sub">
        They’re the reason organisations succeed. That one belief changes
        everything about how we work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Narrative */}
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container narrative">
      <p class="body-lg">
        Somewhere along the way, work got tangled in red tape. HR became about
        control, not connection. Culture became a poster on the wall instead of
        a living, breathing heartbeat. We’re not here to play that game.
      </p>
      <p class="body-lg">
        At Radical HR, we help leaders and teams flip the script and design
        workplaces that actually work - for humans, not just the bottom line.
        Extraordinary teams are never a fluke. They’re intentional. Strategic.
        Human.
      </p>
      <p class="body-lg narrative-turn">
        Our work is built around four pillars that shape every piece of mahi
        (work) we do - from brave conversations to bold culture shifts.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Four pillars */}
  <section class="section band-mist">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">The four pillars</p>
        <h2 class="heading section-title">Attract. Align. Lead. Retain.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="prows">
        {pillars.map((p) => (
          <div class="prow">
            <h3 class="heading prow-name">{p.name}</h3>
            <p class="body prow-line">{p.line}</p>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
      <p class="body-lg integ">
        The four pillars work together - attract the right people, align them
        with purpose, grow leadership that multiplies impact, and keep your best
        people through belonging. We’re here to build teams people actually want
        to be part of. Because extraordinary teams aren’t born. They’re designed…
        <span class="accent">radically.</span>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* The human behind it */}
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container lisa">
      <div class="lisa-photo">
        <Media src="/images/lisa.png" alt="Lisa Shaw, Founder of Radical HR." ratio="4 / 5" caption="Lisa Shaw · Founder · Auckland" />
      </div>
      <div class="lisa-body">
        <p class="eyebrow">The human behind Humans First</p>
        <h2 class="heading lisa-h">Lisa Shaw</h2>
        <p class="body-lg">
          Founder, fractional exec, and a recovering accountant who traded
          spreadsheets for systems that scale impact. Commercial acuity plus
          deep people insight - moving fluidly between detail and strategy,
          boardroom and paddock.
        </p>
        <p class="body-lg">
          Lisa has run businesses, made payroll with no cash in the bank, sat on
          boards, and made the hard calls. The work is grounded in having
          actually carried the weight - not theory for hire.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Social business */}
  <section class="section band-mist">
    <div class="container social">
      <p class="eyebrow">Giving back</p>
      <h2 class="heading social-h">Not just here to do well. Here to do good.</h2>
      <p class="body-lg">
        We exist to re-imagine the future of extraordinary teams - to create
        spaces where people can belong, grow, and lead with courage. We
        challenge the status quo, amplify human potential, and design futures
        where every person has the opportunity and support to truly flourish.
      </p>
      <p class="body-lg">
        Giving back is built into how we work. A share of our energy and mahi
        goes back into people, communities and causes that matter - from youth
        development to the education leaders shaping the next generation.
        Because business should be a force for change, not just a balance
        sheet.
      </p>
      <p class="social-tag">When humans come first, extraordinary happens.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {/* Sister companies */}
  <section class="section" id="ventures">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">Beyond the consultancy</p>
        <h2 class="heading section-title">Our sister companies.</h2>
        <p class="body-lg section-intro">
          Radical HR is one of the things Lisa builds. The same Humans First
          thread runs through all of them.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="ventures">
        <a href="https://www.mpowerhq.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="venture">
          <h3 class="heading venture-name">MPower</h3>
          <p class="venture-tag">Knowledge. Power. Yours.</p>
          <p class="body venture-line">
            Subscription communities putting practical capability where people
            already are, in plain language - from the business side of farming
            to education leaders.
          </p>
          <span class="venture-more">mpowerhq.nz <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
        </a>
        <a href="https://umpireroom.nz" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="venture">
          <h3 class="heading venture-name">Umpire Room</h3>
          <p class="venture-tag">Your umpires’ room, online.</p>
          <p class="body venture-line">
            Software for the people who run netball officiating - everything you
            need to roster, grow and keep your umpires in one place.
          </p>
          <span class="venture-more">umpireroom.nz <span class="arr">&rarr;</span></span>
        </a>
        <div class="venture venture-teaser">
          <h3 class="heading venture-name">Workshop Dashboard</h3>
          <p class="venture-tag">In pilot now</p>
          <p class="body venture-line">
            An operating hub for multi-branch repair workshops - live numbers,
            planning and the daily production meeting in one place. Watch this
            space.
          </p>
          <span class="venture-more venture-soon">Coming soon</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <IndigoBlock
    eyebrow="We’re ready when you are"
    heading="Let’s build your extraordinary team together."
    ctaHref="/contact"
    ctaLabel="Start a conversation"
  />
</Base>

<style>
  .hero { padding-block: clamp(56px, 9vw, 116px) clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); }
  .hero-h1 { font-size: var(--t-h2); max-width: 20ch; }
  .hero-sub { margin-top: 24px; max-width: 44ch; color: var(--c-indigo); font-weight: 600; }

  .narrative { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; max-width: 62ch; }
  .narrative .body-lg { color: var(--c-body); }
  .narrative-turn { font-weight: 600; color: var(--c-indigo) !important; }

  .section-title { font-size: var(--t-h2); }

  .prows { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: clamp(20px, 3vw, 40px); }
  .prow { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .prow-name { font-size: var(--t-h4); color: var(--c-purple); }
  .prow-line { color: var(--c-body); }
  .integ { margin-top: clamp(32px, 4vw, 56px); max-width: 70ch; color: var(--c-body); }

  .lisa {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.85fr 1.15fr;
    gap: clamp(28px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .lisa-photo { max-width: 380px; }
  .lisa-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  .social { max-width: 64ch; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 18px; }
  .lisa-h, .social-h { font-size: var(--t-h3); margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .lisa-body .body-lg, .social .body-lg { color: var(--c-body); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .lisa { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
    .lisa-photo { max-width: 320px; }
  }
  .social-tag { font-family: var(--f-display); font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-purple); font-size: var(--t-body-lg); margin-top: 4px; }

  /* Sister companies */
  .section-intro { max-width: 50ch; color: var(--c-body); }
  .ventures { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: clamp(16px, 2vw, 24px); }
  .venture {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;
    background: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--c-rule); border-radius: var(--radius);
    padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 34px);
    transition: transform .18s var(--ease-out), border-color .18s var(--ease-out), box-shadow .18s var(--ease-out);
  }
  a.venture:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); border-color: var(--c-lilac); box-shadow: 0 18px 40px rgba(101,40,234,0.08); }
  .venture-name { font-size: var(--t-h4); }
  .venture-tag { font-family: var(--f-sans); font-size: var(--t-body-sm); font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--c-purple); }
  .venture-line { color: var(--c-body); }
  .venture-more { margin-top: auto; padding-top: 8px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; color: var(--c-purple); }
  .venture-soon { color: var(--c-lavender); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .ventures { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .prows { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
  }
</style>
